# Compact ice grid for the DISORT-options investigation
# (validation/v24/disort_options/run_variant.py).  Not a production grid:
# every value is a node of ice-cloud-grid-b.lut.
6 uneven_logarithmic # optical depth
0.25 1.0 4.0 16.0 64.0 256.0
5 uneven_linear # physical effective radius, microns
5.0 15.0 33.0 61.0 93.0
4 uneven_linear # solar zenith, degrees
0.0 30.0 60.0 75.0
4 uneven_linear # satellite zenith, degrees
0.0 30.0 60.0 75.0
7 linear # relative azimuth, degrees, 0-180
0 180
